{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35180","headline":"送杨环校书归广南 · 周繇","name":"送杨环校书归广南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天南行李半波涛，滩树枝枝拂戏猱。\n初着蓝衫从远峤，乍辞云署泊轻艘。\n山村象踏桄榔叶，海外人收翡翠毛。\n名宦两成归旧隐，徧寻亲友兴何饶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周繇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35180.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35180","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}